      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787755500296,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Introduction to HTML\n\nHTML is Hypertext markup language\nwhich is developed by tim berners lee in the year 1991\n\nhtml is a language of the web.\n\nWhat is Web?\n    web is collection of resources available through the internet.\n\nInternet\n    internet is network of interconnected systems.\n\nISP -> Internet service provider\nSERVER -> a remote computer system that stores the data of webpages & websites\n\nwebpage\n    webpage is a document written using HTML to structure the content\nwebsite\n    website is a collection of webpages\n\n\n\nClient     Internet (network)  Server\n\nBrowser\n    browser is software that diplays the information written using HTML\n\nURL\n    uniform resource locator which narrows the IP address of the servers\nIP\n    internet protocol unique identifier for the every system that connected to the internet\n\nDNS -> Domain naming servers    100.101.0.1  -> Domain Names\n                                                         100.101.0.1 -> kaywords ( DNS ) \n\n    GoDadyy, Hostingers\n\n\nFilpkart \nhttps://flipkart.com   ->    100.101.0.1\n\nthe process of accessiing the information of the website\n\n\nrequest & response\nrequest is sent by the browsers using the URLS or the webpages\n    \nresponse is the processd data sent back by the servers on the request\n\nClient & server\n\n                DNS Servers\n                                           flipkart.com   :  100.101.0.1",
      "fontSize": 95.53492440600384,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Introduction to HTML\n\nHTML is Hypertext markup language\nwhich is developed by tim berners lee in the year 1991\n\nhtml is a language of the web.\n\nWhat is Web?\n    web is collection of resources available through the internet.\n\nInternet\n    internet is network of interconnected systems.\n\nISP -> Internet service provider\nSERVER -> a remote computer system that stores the data of webpages & websites\n\nwebpage\n    webpage is a document written using HTML to structure the content\nwebsite\n    website is a collection of webpages\n\n\n\nClient     Internet (network)  Server\n\nBrowser\n    browser is software that diplays the information written using HTML\n\nURL\n    uniform resource locator which narrows the IP address of the servers\nIP\n    internet protocol unique identifier for the every system that connected to the internet\n\nDNS -> Domain naming servers    100.101.0.1  -> Domain Names\n                                                         100.101.0.1 -> kaywords ( DNS ) \n\n    GoDadyy, Hostingers\n\n\nFilpkart \nhttps://flipkart.com   ->    100.101.0.1\n\nthe process of accessiing the information of the website\n\n\nrequest & response\nrequest is sent by the browsers using the URLS or the webpages\n    \nresponse is the processd data sent back by the servers on the request\n\nClient & server\n\n                DNS Servers\n                                           flipkart.com   :  100.101.0.1",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
